   Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available.
   We have all except need to verify origin_availability_confirmed and destination_availability_confirmed (set by lock). origin_node_ready and destination_ready set by activate. transport_leg_available still true (not used yet). Good.
16. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
   Preconditions: transport_leg_assembled (true after step15), origin_availability_locked (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile